<section aria-labelledby="icon-h">
  <h2 id="icon-h" class="type-h2">Icon</h2>
  <p>Arche uses Material Icons in the Outlined style, drawn on a 24px grid and shown at 20 by 20. Each one is an SVG file, and a template puts the file straight into the page with <code>{% raw %}{% icon "name" %}{% endraw %}</code>. The fill is <code>currentColor</code>, so an icon is the same color as the text beside it. It follows the text color in every state, with no icon-specific rules.</p>
